# LeakSanitizer suppressions for .github/scripts/sanitize-native.sh.
#
# An entry here is a report that is not a leak in this repository: a
# third-party or system allocation held for the life of the process, or a
# sanitizer artifact. Each one carries a comment saying which, and why. A
# leak in our own code is fixed rather than listed.
#
# Format: leak:<function, source file or module substring>
